window.products.push({"id":524059,"name":"PHF Cooling Bamboo Waffle Blanket Queen Size 90 \"x90, Soft Lightweight Breathable Blanket for Hot Sleepers, Luxury Decorative Cotton Blanket for Couch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cL51Yp7jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"60% Bamboo Fiber, 40% Cotton: Our blanket is comfortable and soft to use by mixing bamboo fiber and cotton in a perfect proportion. Unlike ordinary cotton blankets, the moment your skin touches the blanket, you will feel an unexpected silky touch. In addition, the double insurance of bamboo and cotton improves the softness of this blanket. The overall use will give your skin a higher level of comfort. Exquisite Waffle Weave Design: The uneven waffle three-dimensional design, coupled with the exquisite weaving process, makes our blankets fluffy and durable. The special waffle fabric helps to circulate the air, regulate the temperature, absorb moisture, and enhance the permeability of the blanket, which is another important reason for the comfort of the blanket. In addition, the elegant and fashionable waffle blanket provides a new choice for your home decoration. All Season Comfort: Because of the perfect combination of bamboo fiber and cotton, our blankets can be used all year round and are indispensable bedding in daily life. Soft, breathable, moisture absorption, moderate temperature. In the cold winter, he can drive away the cold for you and let you burn in your sleep on a cold day; When used in a hot summer, it brings you a cool feeling. Best gift and Versatile Blanket: When you relax, take a nap, travel and take a bus, it can be used as any blanket you want, such as sofa blanket, nap blanket, travel blanket, air conditioning blanket, etc; A comfortable and decorative blanket is a great gift for friends and family. Valentine's day, father's day, mother's day, Christmas, and any time you want to share joy or gratitude, choose it to convey love and let love fall all over the room. Wash and Care with Laundry Bag: Machine wash on a soft mode. (A laundry bag comes with the blanket. We recommend that you use a laundry bag when washing the blanket. The most important thing is to reduce the damage to the fiber and the service life of the blanket can be increased.) Machine wash in cold water and dry at low temperature. Avoid using bleach or fabric softener. We suggest hanging and drying in a cool and ventilated place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cL51Yp7jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PHF","source_asin":"B0C2HKS4F6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-524059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2HKS4F6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2HKS4F6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
