window.products.push({"id":524179,"name":"MURUFUL Throw Pillow Covers Banana and Golden Palm Leaf Cotton Linen Cushion Covers Tropical Palm Exotic Flower Tree Summer Plant Abstract Hawaii Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71biKVI3-8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Information 1.Size: 18”×18” Inches (45cmx45cm),Pillows Not Included.  2.Material: Polyester Material, Soft And Comfortable.  3.The Flat Sewing Stitches Are Not Easy To Open And Deform, And The Invisible Zipper Opening Design Is Convenient For Loading And Unloading The Pillow Core Without Losing Its Beauty. It Is Practical And Decorative.  4.Suitable For Sofa Pillowcases, Bed Cushion Covers, Car Cushion Covers, Chair Pillowcases. Product Design Pink Flamingo ,Summer Tropical Palm Leaves And Flowers ,Pink Flamingo Pillowcase,Summer Tropical Palm Leaves And Flowers Pillowcover,Are All Classic Elements,Never Out Of Date.Beautiful Patterns Decorate Your Home And Bring A Good Mood To You And Your Family. Cleaning And Care Instructions 1.Gentle Hand Wash.  2.Machine Washable, Machine Washable Below 60°c.  3.Do Not Bleach, Do Not Iron, And Let It Dry Naturally. Attention 1.Due To Different Measurement Methods, The Product Data Will Have An Error Of 1-2cm, Which Is A Normal Phenomenon.  2.Due To Objective Factors Such As Production Batches, Machinery And Equipment, Shooting Angles, Etc., It Is Difficult To Avoid Or There Will Be Minor Chromatic Aberrations, Position And Size Errors, And The Above Problems Are Normal.  Thank You And Wish You Have A Happy Shopping Time !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71biKVI3-8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MURUFUL","source_asin":"B09QHYWM87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-524179","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QHYWM87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QHYWM87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
