window.products.push({"id":524275,"name":"Superhero Party Supplies Kit with Superhero Tablecloth, Superhero Birthday Banner and 20 Superhero Balloons - Complete Superhero Decorations Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914CpizYuHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ BUILT TO LAST AND IMPRESS - While most party decorations can look and feel cheap, letting you down in the middle of your our party, our superhero birthday party supplies are made with bright and sturdy materials that will wow your guests and survive even the most energetic super hero party. ✅ SUPERHERO BANNER - READY TO HANG - Most party banners arrive in pieces, requiring you to spend time threading them, often have letters missing or bunch up on the string. Our Happy Birthday Superhero Banner comes pre-stitched with a yellow ribbon and thick card, leaving you time to focus on your superheroes. ✅ FUN PARTY TABLECLOTH - Protect your table and seat your super heroes around our strong plastic superhero table cover. Measuring a healthy 108x54 inches (9x4.5ft), our plastic table cloth can be used outside or in, and has a superhero cityscape backdrop design to keep your little ones engaged in the superhero theme. ✅ 20 BIRTHDAY BALLOONS YOU’LL LOVE - Most superhero birthday balloons lose their color when inflated or have faded graphics clumsily printed on them. We make sure that our large 12-inch latex balloons are super vibrant with crisp printed graphics that will bring a burst of color to your Avengers party. Also, they’ll hold helium for up to 18 hours, so the kids can enjoy them long after the birthday party ends. ✅ SAVE TIME PLANNING with a FREE Superhero Party E-Book on us, giving you superhero party ideas for decorations, food and even printable super hero table decorations to complete your party theme.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914CpizYuHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Memory Building Company","source_asin":"B07SQ2TTSP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-524275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SQ2TTSP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SQ2TTSP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":524276,"name":"Metal seahorse sculpture-Nautical shelf decor-17inch solid cast aluminium-rustic beach Figurines for the contemporary living room-Bathroom metal art-T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q7qGdQMhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CONSTRUCT: Hand crafted and cast in Aluminium metal, the embossed Raw finish is detailed with Silver colored accents that ramps up the artistic look. It is sure to grab attention wherever you choose to display it. SIZED to stand an impressive 17”high 9” wide between its snout and dorsal fin; mounted on a base 3.5” high MEANING OR ART FORM: You will love everything about the elusive and mysterious seahorse. If you ever thought of catching one to have in your home; well this embossed metal seahorse may not have been in the ocean, ever, but it is the deep sea come true. DESCRIPTION: Seahorse is the name given to 46 species of small marine fish in the genus Hippocampus. ‘Hippo’ means \"horse\" and “kampos” sea monster. in ancient Greek .The Seahorse has a head and neck suggestive of a horse, they also feature segmented bony armour, an upright posture and a curled prehensile tail. Unusually among fish, a seahorse has a flexible, well-defined neck. It also sports a crown-like spine or horn on its head, termed a \"coronet\", which is distinct for each species. Seahorses swim very poorly, rapidly fluttering a dorsal fin and using pectoral fins to steer. Seahorses swim upright, propelling themselves using the dorsal fin, another characteristic not shared by their close pipefish relatives, which swim horizontally","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q7qGdQMhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Father'sDen Collection","source_asin":"B08SWDXL42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-524276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SWDXL42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SWDXL42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
