window.products.push({"id":524465,"name":"Electric Towel Warmer Bucket, Flip-lid Towel Warmers for Bathroom, Spa, Home, Extra Large (20 Liter) Blanket Warmer, Holds Two 70\"X40\" Towels, Robes, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616yFn7flnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plastic A GIFT THAT WILL ALWAYS BE REMEMBERED-This towel warmer will be a gift that will be used and appreciated for years after the special day has passed! Whenever your loved one is wrapped in a warm towel or blanket, she/he will be reminded of the love they received from you. Best Valentine's Day gift, Birthday gift, New Year gift, Mother's Day gift, Christmas gift for women, girls, adults, friends, families. PORTABLE TOWEL WARMER. INSTALLATION FREE - Some towel heaters need to be drilled into the wall to set up the whole thing, while our bucket-style bath towel warmer just needs to be plugged into a nearby outlet. It can be placed everywhere on the dry floor. This freestanding towel warmer has a stylish design and is easy to move. You might consider placing it in your bathroom, bedroom, nursery, living room. The towel warmers make your life more cozy and luxurious in an easy way. LARGE HEATING COMPARTMENT - With a total of 20 Liter capacity inside the volume, this towel heater accommodates up to two 70''X40'' oversized bath towels, robes, throw blankets, PJs, and more at once or larger bath sheets. It's a must-have household appliance for big families. HEAT FAST AND EVENLY- The towel dryer heat up within just 1 minute and reaches high temperature in just 6 minutes. It takes just 15 minutes, 2 large towels will be toasted perfectly and heated evenly. This Luxury Bucket Towel Warmer is single button control, provides you with up to 60 minutes of warming. No more cold spots when you cover yourself with a warm-up towel. AUTOMATIC SHUT OFF FOR SAFETY USE - Our bucket towel warmer is ETL&FCC certificated, safe and reliable. The towel warmers are designed with an automatic shutoff function to prevent safety issues, it will shut off automatically after 60 minutes of heating time. There is a novel and thoughtful design of our blanket warmer: unlike removable lids, our lid is connected to the bucket, the flip-lid will free your hands while you get the towel out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616yFn7flnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Guioiby","source_asin":"B0B7X7LR1P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-524465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7X7LR1P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7X7LR1P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
