window.products.push({"id":524547,"name":"Maria Jane 22 Piece Set Cupcake Decorating Tips, Piping Tips / Russian Piping Tips Complete With Gift Box, 10 Different Icing Tips, 10 Disposable Pipi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KdEjvs3oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What's Included? 10x different icing tips 10x disposable piping bags 2x Couplers 1x Brown gift / storage Box Features Comes complete with a gift box Lightweight, strong, corrosion resistant and durable - rust free Easy to use Ideal for decorating cookies, cakes, cupcakes etc Lifetime guarantee - hassle free refund We have tried to make your cake designing process as easy and hassle free as possible with 10 piping bags, 10 icing tips and 2 couplers. When designing your cake, quickly fill multiple bags with the required icing and color’s with multiple couplers and icing tips at your disposal quickly and easily switch between styles and color’s without worrying about cleaning in-between. How to use Russian piping tips? 1.Wash the nozzle in hot water.  2. Prepare the piping bag cutting so that 1-2 mm of nozzle can pop out of piping bag.  3. Insert the nozzle in the bag.  4. Put the icing in a bag. Icing must be firm, room temperature, not too soft.  5.Place the nozzle to the cupcake/cake base, while squeezing gently, life nozzle.  6.Clean the end of the nozzle.  7.Use a leaf nozzle to fill in gaps--this will complement the overall effect.  8.If the icing is too soft the buds will be closed. Pop in the fridge, if necessary.  9.After use, ideally wash in hot soapy water and dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KdEjvs3oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maria Jane","source_asin":"B01M0EPZHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-524547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M0EPZHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M0EPZHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
