window.products.push({"id":524578,"name":"Design Toscano WU71647 Wings of Isis Egyptian Revival Desk Mantel Clock Statue, 16 Inch, full color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":145.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g2bby-7uL._AC_.jpg","description":"With wings spread to showcase a beautiful quartz clock with hieroglyphic numerals, double Isis figures ride a foot-long barge to the Afterworld in this stunning Egyptian Revival work. True to the decorative arts of the 1920's, this quality designer resin statement work blends style and function as it glows in the rich palette of the ancient world. Accepts your single AA battery. 13½ \"Wx5\"Dx16\"H. 7 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g2bby-7uL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Design Toscano","source_asin":"B004AB34G2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-524578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004AB34G2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004AB34G2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":524579,"name":"Pyrex 692264408076 Storage 14-Piece Round Set, Clear with Blue Lids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412A7A5P33L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Pyrex Stores Anything and Everything The Pyrex Storage 14-piece set with lids includes four each of 2-cup round bowls with blue plastic storage covers, two each of 4-cup round bowls with blue plastic storage covers and one each of 7-cup round bowls with blue plastic storage covers. Pyrex Storage products come with seal tight plastic lids for secure food storage. They are designed for reheating leftovers and convenient refrigerator storage. The durability of Pyrex Storage allows stacking for efficient space utilization. Pyrex Storage 14-Piece Set: Set includes one 7-cup, four 2-cup and two 4-cup round bowls, as well as seven blue plastic lids Set includes one 7-cup, four 2-cup and two 4-cup round bowls, as well as seven blue plastic lids Made of nonporous glass that won't warp, stain or absorb odors Made of nonporous glass that won't warp, stain or absorb odors Seal-tight lids are ideal for secure food storage Seal-tight lids are ideal for secure food storage Stackable design Stackable design Bowls safe for use in oven, microwave, refrigerator and freezer Bowls safe for use in oven, microwave, refrigerator and freezer Dimensions: Measures: 14.2 in. x 10.2 in. x 6.2 in. A Closer Look: There's no substitute for Pyrex, the original glass bakeware. Introduced 90 years ago and made of a durable, high-temperature material, Pyrex remains the ideal medium for safe, dependable food preparation. Take Care: Dishwasher safe. Amazon.com Keep your leftovers chilled or frozen in these durable glass containers with plastic lids. The clear glass lets you see at a glance what's inside, and the stackability factor helps you neatly store dried pasta, cereal, and other items on your shelf. When you're ready to reheat those leftovers, bring to room temperature then warm in the oven or microwave. Pyrex glass is nonporous, so it won't stain or absorb food odors. And, unlike plastic containers, glass won't emit harmful chemicals during microwave use. This 14-piece storage set consists of seven round glass bowls: one large seven-cup; two medium-size four-cup; and four handy two-cup (great for lunches). Each has its own seal-tight, blue plastic lid. Incredibly durable as long as sudden changes in temperature are avoided, Pyrex glassware is safe for the oven, microwave, freezer, refrigerator, and dishwasher, and even looks good serving at the table. Please avoid using the lids in the microwave and oven, and wash by hand or on the dishwasher's top rack. Pyrex covers the glass bowls with a two-year warranty, and the lids with a one-year warranty. Pyrex glass is made in the USA. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412A7A5P33L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pyrex","source_asin":"B0000CFTB0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-524579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CFTB0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CFTB0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":524580,"name":"KitchenAid Roaster Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4180E5K3NQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Large roasting pan with wire rack Amazon.com Shorter days and cooler weather are a sure sign that its time to cook heavier, more satisfying foods. However, satisfying does not necessarily mean unhealthy when it comes to making a meaty roast. Measuring 12 by 15 inches and with a capacity of up to 25 pounds, this durable rectangular roaster can handle everything from a Sunday dinner boneless pork loin to a gigantic Thanksgiving turkey with all the trimmings. The included rack holds meats above the pan so fat and oil drip away and a leaner, healthier roast remains. Made of heavy-gauge carbon steel with sturdy rolled edges, this roasting pan is well-balanced for lugging heavier roasts. In addition, the steel construction offers the perfect heat distribution required for roasting or baking and wont warp under high oven temperatures. Anodized cast aluminum handles at either end provide a slip-free grip and are bolted on in an upright position, which feels more natural for lifting and carrying. The floating steel rack securely rests on the handles interior bolts and wont shift during movement or scratch the bottom of the pan. Both the roaster and the rack have a high-performance nonstick coating that is resistant to even the toughest grease and oil residue. Conveniently, the nonstick coating is safe for cooking under the broiler, cooking with metal utensils, and cleaning in the dishwasher without concern of weakening its release properties. In addition to meats, the roaster can be used without the rack to roast potatoes or even bake a large, deep-dish lasagne. KitchenAid offers a one-year hassle-free replacement warranty on this roaster set. --Cristina Vaamonde","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4180E5K3NQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lifetime Brands","source_asin":"B0002V3ZZE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-524580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002V3ZZE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002V3ZZE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
