window.products.push({"id":524605,"name":"LELELINKY 3 Tier End Table, Record Player Stand with Storage Up to 100 Albums, Industrial Tall Side Tables, Turntable Stand for Vinyl Storage, Brown R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QpzIZ0VoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎵 [ Simple Record Player Stand ] The vintage vinyl record player stand has 3 tiers. The spacious tabletop is suitable for multiple sized record players. The 2nd and 3rd open storage shelves can hold all kinds of records and media essentials, storing up to 100 albums. The categorized storage of vinyl record holder combines art and practicality, filling your room with artistic atmosphere and keeping neatness. 🎵 [ Multifunctional End Table ] It also is a great side table or end table for your bedroom, living room and other small spaces. The proper height of this little table will make you convenient when taking a glass of warm milk or picking up other items on it. The two U-shaped dividers are removable, so that you can get a bigger single storage space at the bottom. (Narrow bedside table size: 11.81 \"D x 15.86 \"W x 25.67 \"H) 🎵 [ Retro Classic Design ] The mid-century record player table combines the rustic brown wood grain with matte black metal stand, which retains the vintage feel of the wood grain without compromising the modern industrial style. The turntable stand is made of EPA certificated wood board, corrosion and rust resistant metal frame, which ensures a longer usage. 🎵 [ Thoughtful Designed Details ] The classic rectangular frame of the tall record display shelf and lightweight design helps you move and carry it more easily. And we set up iron net and small wooden boards that can prevent the records and the items from falling off the 2nd and 3rd open shelves of the record player stand. We also designed adjustable feet to help the record player cabinet stay level on uneven floors. 🎵 [ Thicker Packaging & Easy to Assemble ] We pack these industrial record player stands in thicker foam and tough cardboard boxes to ensure they arrive in good conditions. These vinyl album turntable stands come with detailed instructions, labeled parts and assembly tools to help you assemble the album organizer shelf more easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QpzIZ0VoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LELELINKY","source_asin":"B0C6ZGYPLD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-524605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6ZGYPLD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6ZGYPLD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
