window.products.push({"id":524876,"name":"4500 Sq. Ft 50 Pint Dehumidifier for Basement, COLAZE Dehumidifiers with Drain Hose for Home Bedroom Bathroom Large Room, Auto Defrost & Full Water Al","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ewomzd5+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☆. 4,500 sq ft Dehumidifier for Basement and Home: COLAZE home dehumidifier with 1.59 gallon water tank capacity removes up to 50 pints (70 Pint 2012 DOE Standard) from the air per day. It is great for basement. This dehumidifier can safely and effectively remove excess moisture and peculiar smell in the air, great for your bathroom, bedroom, garage, office, kitchen, large room, storage room and RV. ☆. Intelligent Humidity Control Dehumidifier: COLAZE basement dehumidifier is equipped with a smart screen with touch control, which is easy to operate without worrying about button damage. In the normal dehumidification mode, customize the humidity (30% - 80% RH). When the specified humidity is reached, it will automatically stop working. ☆. High Effective Dehumidification: Our bathroom dehumidifier has an efficient and energy-saving compressor, which increases the fan speed to remove moisture to the maximum extent. It can quickly and effectively reduce humidity, maintain dry air level, and make you feel more comfortable. ☆. Auto or Manual Drainage with Drain Hose: Our dehumidifiers are equipped with drainage hoses. You can not only drain water manually, but also insert hoses to achieve automatic drainage. The water tank is 6L/1.59 gallon, when it reaches maximum capacity, the \"Full \"indicator will light up as well as an alarm will beep to remind you to empty the water tank, and the dehumidifier will stop working automatically at the same time. ☆. Super Easy To Use: This home dehumidifier is very simple and convenient to use. You just need to adjust to the ideal humidity setting, and then let it run continuously until the tank is full, at which time it will automatically close. It also has the function of automatic defrosting, so you don't need to pay too much attention to it. The dehumidifier also has the function of child lock to prevent children from touching by mistake. ☆. More Practical Functions: Our dehumidifier has three working modes, including automatic, dry clothes and air supply. Even in wet weather, you can easily dry clothes. In addition, it has a timer function, you can time it automatically switch on and off, and It works quietly. The 360-degree rotating wheels of this dehumidifiers for basements allow it to be easily moved from one location to another.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Ewomzd5+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COLAZE","source_asin":"B0BRMV4J2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-524876","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRMV4J2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRMV4J2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
